From 83acbbd6cd80b06dbfa1e41123ecf2b246e66241 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TimeAndDatePro Agent <agent@timeanddatepro.local>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 03:38:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] refactor(date-to-words): cleanup copy, add date picker,
 wire related tools to real routes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Remove 'Five formats, 1 to 9999, locale-aware' from lede
- Remove ⌘K shortcut hint from hero
- Remove ↵ Enter hint from CTA row
- Remove 'Client-side · 0ms' from tool head
- Remove 'auto-detect' hint from date field
- Change 'Locale' to 'Language' in the field label
- Remove Calendar field and 'gregorian' hint
- Add native date picker (📅 trigger button + hidden <input type='date'>)
- Wire all 12 related tools to their real routes:
  * Built tools → /en/<slug> (date-math, date-diff, countdown, etc.)
  * Not-yet-built → /feedback?type=suggestion&tool=<slug>
    (word-to-date, age-calculator, week-number)
- Input row grid: 3 columns → 2 columns (Date + Language)
